    "title": "Busy Agenda Awaits Dumont City Council at Thursday Session - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jason Eaton ,\n1 hours ago The Dumont City Council will meet in regular session Thursday night at the Dumont EMS Building. The agenda includes updates from Hampton-Dumont High School Principal Matt Trosky and Industrial Technology Teacher Jared Ites on the bus barn shelter project. Butler County Auditor Leslie Groen is also scheduled to brief the council on recent election results. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
